{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880760/extras/efb8038a93cab4837e2024e911f43a09.avif?t=1773258322\" width=800 height=353 /></span>The gods have disappeared from the heavens, all magic has vanished from the world. This coincided with the emergence of a mysterious tower on the horizon, visible from anywhere in the world, which has attracted countless lost souls thirsting for answers. You are Tola, a warrior tormented by the past who, by a twist of fate, saves the angel Azazel from being swallowed by the tower. Now, you both set out together to unravel the mysteries of the enigmatic Tower of Babel, a structure that makes no sense in the mortal world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Non-Linear World</strong> - Explore the Tower of Babel in an interconnected world filled with diverse settings with many secrets and hidden paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Combat</strong> - Explore a wide variety of abilities and discover new ways to use your arsenal of weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong> - Use your entire arsenal in battles against colossal enemies, survive devastating attacks, and test your skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the mysteries of the tower</strong> - Uncover the stories hidden in the mysterious Tower of Babel, a place beyond time and space where each floor houses cities and even entire continents!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880760?t=1773258322","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880760?t=1773258322","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a