ng attacks, and test your skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel the mysteries of the tower</strong> - Uncover the stories hidden in the mysterious Tower of Babel, a place beyond time and space where each floor houses cities and even entire continents!</p>","developers":["Cosmos Est\u00fadios"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Dairan Caetano da Silva ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880760/5a8547912aac38aa231365d2add0ba4d34e3d07d/header.jpg?t=1773258322","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3880760/137449329/ac560d590c86e502a1da1a006e500315ff5bb1d5/1773182302/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773258312","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3880760/137449329/ac560d590c86e502a1da1a006e500315ff5bb1d5/1773182302/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773258312","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3880760/137449329/ac560d590c86e502a1da1a006e500315ff5bb1d5/1773182302/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773258312","id":257301298,"name":"Babel Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257301298/2e2147f43fe4a182618374ff78a3b794b549d337/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773258312"}],"name":"Babel","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 700 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphi